    "Name": "Viper VPR-M",
    "Details": "Introduced in 2940, the Viper is a 40-ton OmniMech that emphasizes speed and armor, with only 8.5 tons of podspace available for weapons. A 320-rated XL Engine powers the Viper and 8 Jump Jets are hardwired into the chassis, further improving the mobility. The Viper M-R (Medusa) is armed with a 6 ER Small Lasers and a Streak SRM-6. An AMS is mounted to counter incoming missiles. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
